lor: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Type de donnée\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EvenementStructure.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EvenementStructure-definitions.html#EvenementStructure.etatObjet\" title=\"Etat de l'objet  lié suite à l'événement\">etatObjet</a><a name=\"EvenementStructure.etatObjet\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#Coding\">Coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Etat de l'objet  lié suite à l'événement<br class=\"binding\"/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold binding\">Binding: </span><a href=\"https://smt.esante.gouv.fr/fhir/CodeSystem/tre-r366-type-objet?vs\" class=\"binding\">https://smt.esante.gouv.fr/fhir/CodeSystem/tre-r366-type-objet?vs</a><span class=\"binding\"> (</span><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/terminologies.html#preferred\" title=\"Instances are encouraged to draw from the specified codes for interoperability purposes but are not required to do so to be considered conformant.\" class=\"binding\">preferred</a><span class=\"binding\">)</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Type de donnée\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: abso